mall></div>`).join('')}<p class=\"calculation\">Remaining = budget − actual. Annualized scenario = selected month × 12, not a prediction. Month changes adjust the two sample departmental expenses.</p>`;$('#expense').onchange=e=>{expense=Math.max(0,Math.min(1e8,Number(e.target.value)||0));renderLab()};$('#budget-month').onchange=e=>{budgetMonth=Number(e.target.value);renderLab()};$('#budget-export').onclick=()=>csvDownload('budget-demo.csv',[['Demonstration Data'],['Month',budgetMonth+1],['Department','Budget','Actual','Remaining'],...names.map((n,i)=>[n,budgets[i],actual[i],budgets[i]-actual[i]])]);}\nconst services=[['2026-08-12','Preventive','PO-DEMO-041','Oil, filter, and load test',2400000],['2026-09-18','Corrective','PO-DEMO-058','Replace starter battery',1850000],['2026-10-20','Preventive','PO-DEMO-072','Cooling system inspection',950000]];let serviceType='All';function maintenance(){const rows=services.filter(r=>serviceType==='All'||r[1]===serviceType);$('#workspace').innerHTML=workspaceHeading('04','One machine. The full paper trail.','<button class=\"dark-button\" id=\"service-pdf\">Generate bundled PDF ↓</button>')+`<div class=\"lab-controls\"><span>DEMO-GEN-01 / Backup generator</span><label>Service type<select id=\"service-type\">${['All','Preventive','Corrective'].map(t=>`<option ${t===serviceType?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div>${rows.map(r=>`<article class=\"service-row\"><time>${r[0]}</time><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">${r[1]} / ${r[2]}</span><h4>${r[3]}</h4></div><strong>${money(r[4])}</strong></article>`).join('')}<p style=\"margin-top:20px\">Visible service cost: <b>${money(rows.reduce((s,r)=>s+r[4],0))}</b></p><p class=\"calculation\">Next planned inspection: 20 November 2026. Outstanding: verify cooling-hose replacement recommendation. The PDF bundles a summary and three fictional service sheets.</p>`;$('#service-type').onchange=e=>{serviceType=e.target.value;renderLab()};$('#service-pdf').onclick=()=>action($('#service-pdf'),async()=>{if(!window.PDFLib)await new Promise((res,rej)=>{const s=document.createElement('script');s.src='https:\\x2f\\x2fcdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pdf-lib@1.17.1/dist/pdf-lib.min.js';s.onload=res;s.onerror=()=>rej(new Error('PDF library could not load.'));document.head.appendChild(s)});const pdf=await PDFLib.PDFDocument.create();const font=await pdf.embedFont(PDFLib.StandardFonts.Helvetica);const lines=[['THE LIVING INDEX / MAINTENANCE','Demonstration Data - fictional records only','Equipment: DEMO-GEN-01 / Backup generator','Total service cost: IDR 5,200,000','Next inspection: 20 November 2026','Follow-up: review cooling-hose replacement recommendation.'],...services.map(r=>['SERVICE RECORD / '+r[2],'Demonstration Data - fictional records only','Equipment: DEMO-GEN-01','Date: '+r[0],'Type: '+r[1],'Work: '+r[3],'Cost: IDR '+r[4].toLocaleString('en-US')])];lines.forEach((ls,i)=>{const page=pdf.addPage([595,842]);ls.forEach((s,j)=>page.drawText(s,{x:50,y:760-j*36,size:j===0?17:11,font}));page.drawText(`${i+1} / ${lines.length}`,{x:50,y:40,size:10,font});});Engine.downloadBlob('maintenance-demo.pdf',new Blob([await pdf.save()],{type:'application/pdf'}));});}\nlet scheduleState={month:'2026-11',names:'Team A, Team B, Team C',holidays:'2026-11-10',weekdays:true};function scheduling(){const people=scheduleState.names.split(',').map(n=>n.trim()).filter(Boolean);const duplicate=new Set(people.map(n=>n.toLowerCase())).size!==people.length;const rows=schedule(scheduleState.month,people,scheduleState.holidays.split(',').map(s=>s.trim()),scheduleState.weekdays);$('#workspace').innerHTML=workspaceHeading('05','A rhythm that adjusts itself.',`<button class=\"dark-button\" id=\"schedule-export\" ${!rows.length||duplicate?'disabled':''}>Export Excel ↓</button>`)+`<div class=\"lab-controls\"><label>Month<input id=\"schedule-month\" type=\"month\" value=\"${scheduleState.month}\"></label><label>Rotation, comma-separated<input id=\"schedule-names\" value=\"${esc(scheduleState.