${item.id}\">Add to cart +</button></div></article>`).join(''):'<div class=\"commerce-empty\"><h4>Nothing matches that search.</h4><p>Try a category or a simpler word.</p></div>';\n    $$('[data-commerce-add]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const item=product(button.dataset.commerceAdd),select=$(`[data-commerce-variant=\"${item.id}\"]`),variant=select.value,key=commerceKey(item.id,variant),stock=stockFor(item,variant);if((cart[key]||0)>=stock){toast(`Only ${stock} available in this demonstration.`);return;}cart[key]=(cart[key]||0)+1;view.voucherMessage='';persist();drawCart();toast(`${item.name} added.`);});\n  }\n  function drawCart(){const lines=cartLines(),amounts=totals();$('#commerce-cart-count').textContent=lines.reduce((sum,line)=>sum+line.quantity,0);$('#commerce-cart-content').innerHTML=`<div class=\"commerce-cart-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR CART</span><button id=\"commerce-clear\" ${lines.length?'':'disabled'}>Clear</button></div>${lines.length?`<div class=\"commerce-cart-lines\">${lines.map(line=>`<article><div><b>${esc(line.item.name)}</b><small>${esc(line.variant)}</small><span>${commerceMoney(line.item.price)}</span></div><div class=\"commerce-quantity\"><button data-commerce-minus=\"${esc(line.key)}\" aria-label=\"Reduce ${esc(line.item.name)}\">−</button><span>${line.quantity}</span><button data-commerce-plus=\"${esc(line.key)}\" aria-label=\"Add another ${esc(line.item.name)}\">+</button></div></article>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class=\"commerce-cart-empty\"><p>Your cart is still quiet.</p><span>Add a product to start the calculation.</span></div>'}<form class=\"commerce-voucher\" id=\"commerce-voucher-form\"><label>Voucher code<input name=\"voucher\" value=\"${esc(view.voucher)}\" placeholder=\"WELCOME10 or SHIP20\"></label><button type=\"submit\">Apply</button></form><p class=\"commerce-voucher-note\" role=\"status\">${esc(view.voucherMessage||'Demo codes: WELCOME10 / SHIP20')}</p><label class=\"commerce-shipping\">Shipping<select id